# The trained model and cached features ARE committed, so a fresh clone can skip
# the ~1 hour training run and the ~8 minute feature extraction pass:
#   best_model.keras   trained captioning model
#   tokenizer.pkl      word index - must match the model, don't regenerate on its own
#   features.pkl.gz    VGG16 features, gzipped
#
# features.pkl itself is ignored: at 127 MB it is over GitHub's 100 MB per-file
# hard limit, so the gzipped copy (~48 MB) is what gets committed.
features.pkl

